# Keep the Docker build context lean. NOTE: do NOT ignore `target/` (Dockerfile.svc
# copies the built jars + libs) or `frontends/shelf-app/build/web` (Dockerfile.web
# copies the compiled web bundle).

.git
.gitignore
.github
*.md
docs/
k6/
tools/
confy.sh

# IDE / OS cruft
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Java build noise (jars in target/ are still included)
**/surefire-reports
**/maven-status
**/generated-sources
**/generated-test-sources

# Flutter: keep build/web (needed); drop dev caches + non-web platforms + sources
# not used by the static image.
frontends/shelf-app/.dart_tool
frontends/shelf-app/test
frontends/shelf-app/android
frontends/shelf-app/ios
frontends/shelf-app/linux
frontends/shelf-app/macos
frontends/shelf-app/windows
